{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Place location restrictions on vape shops & standardise vape product packaging",
        "additional_details": "We believe the following restrictions should be placed on these vape shops:\r\n\u2022 No vape shop should operate within 200 metres of residential housing\r\n\u2022 No vape shop should operate within 800 metres of 0-18 education spaces such as nurseries, primary or secondary schools\r\n\u2022 Vape shops to be exempt from using \"skilled worker\" visas\r\n\u2022 Vape shops signs and vape product packaging to be made plain, similar to how to tobacco products are now\r\n",
        "background": "We call on the Government to place restrictions on the location and number of vape shops, as we believe this will improve health and safety of communities. We also call on vape shop signs and vape product packaging to be made plain in line with tobacco products and sellers.",
